# Copy to /etc/totemd/totemd.env, fill in the key, chmod 600, chown totemd.
# Referenced by totemd.service's (B) EnvironmentFile option. Never commit the real file.
TOTEM_ADDR=127.0.0.1:8683
TOTEM_DB_PATH=/var/lib/totemd/totem.db
TOTEM_DB_KEY=change-me-to-a-long-random-key
# Absolute asset paths (see totemd.service): without these the emoji map is
# empty and animal images 404, because the CWD-relative defaults resolve to /.
TOTEM_EMOJI_FILE=/var/lib/totemd/data/emoji.json
TOTEM_IMAGE_DIR=/var/lib/totemd/data/images
# TOTEM_ALLOWED_ORIGINS widens which Origins may open a game WebSocket. Leave it
# UNSET in production: the WAF forwards its own Host, so same-origin already
# matches, and anything listed here is a page allowed to drive players' games.
# It exists for the Vite dev proxy only (run-dev.sh sets it).
